They are no longer fundamental theories. They are demoted to effective approximate descriptions of TDMU under specific boundary conditions, precisely as Newtonian mechanics is the low-velocity limit of relativity and classical mechanics is the ℏ→0ℏ→0 limit of quantum mechanics.
TDMU is the new foundational layer. Standard theories are approximation layers of TDMU.
